# [[.Name]]

Documentation site. Generated by kickhub from `[[.Template]]` v[[.Version]].

```sh
make serve    # live preview on http://localhost:8000
make build    # the same strict build CI runs
```

Pages are Markdown files under `docs/`, listed in `mkdocs.yml`.

## Publishing

Every merge to `main` publishes to GitHub Pages. Turn it on once: repository Settings, then Pages, then set the source to "GitHub Actions".
